  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening National and Regional Capacity in the Criminal Justice Response to Trafficking in Persons</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNODC Human Trafficking and Migrant Smuggling Unit will continue to strengthen the criminal justice capacity of governments through delivery of anti-TIP training and legislative assistance. J/TIP will identify countries to receive this short-term training and technical assistance in coordination with UNODC.</narrative>
  </description>
